Description: Soplos Theme Manager
 A graphical tool to manage desktop themes in Soplos Linux Tyron (XFCE).
 Features include:
  * Apply, create, export and import complete XFCE desktop themes
  * Built-in wallpaper browser and selector
  * Avatar manager replacing Mugshot
  * Panel and Dock configuration (Docklike integration)
  * Theme export/import as .sth bundles
  * Screenshot-based theme previews
  * Modern dark interface with multi-language support (8 languages)
